{"t": 1793284884467, "cmd": "note", "args": ["--shot", "dream_stuck", "After E at the door ('You sleep, and dream.') the world turns grey and the HUD clock runs BACKWARDS (6:56 pm -> 6:03 -> 4:33 -> 2:46 pm over ~45 game seconds). NEXT says only 'Nothing here seems strange'; walking, E and C do nothing. No hint how to wake or what to do; ~6 minutes wall-clock with no progress. Expected: a NEXT instruction or the dream to end and morning to come."]}
